            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "トレーナーさん、聞いてください！\r\n今すごい格言を思いついたんです。\nずばり――",
            "enText": "Hey, listen to this! I thought up an amazing \nproverb just now! Here it is ——",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -4502644730115521111,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "――『早起きの麗らかな朝日は\r\nにんじんを甘くする』！",
            "enText": "\"The carrot eaten in morning sunlight \ntastes sweetest\"!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -822219059319455853,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "……むむっ、ちょっと回りくどいかな。\r\nもっと端的に、もっと格言らしく……。",
            "enText": "…Hm, maybe that's too vague. \nA proverb should be more succinct…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 3967373171437529587,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "サクラチヨノオー",
            "enName": "Sakura Chiyono O",
            "jpText": "――『早起きは、にんじん3本』！\r\nうん、これでバッチリですっ！",
            "enText": "\"The early riser gets three carrots\"! \nYeah, that's perfect!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
